excalibur-control-center (0.5.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Debian 13 / Ubuntu 24.04 packaging. Identical package contents to 0.5.5;
    this revision makes the release asset names and SHA256SUMS consistent (the
    "~" in "~deb13"/"~ubuntu24.04" is rewritten by the release host).

